# ownership and review routing without pretending that self-review is independent
# review. The canonical main-branch ruleset therefore requires a pull request,
# dismisses stale reviews, requires review-thread resolution and required CI, but
# does not require Code Owner approval or a positive approval count while the
# solo-maintainer bootstrap posture applies.
